"commune : ``Event{Version: JournalVersion, Time: now, Phase: a.Phase, "
"Section: a.Section, Label: a.Label, Round: a.Round, Key: a.Key}``, puis :"
msgstr ""
"``EventFromAction`` translates a confirmed action into an event. Common "
"base: ``Event{Version: JournalVersion, Time: now, Phase: a.Phase, "
"Section: a.Section, Label: a.Label, Round: a.Round, Key: a.Key}``, then:"

